{"kind": "mod", "id": 874, "name": "AES", "slug": "aes", "teaser": "3 interactive Traders, offering a wide range of quests and interactions between them, with extensive lore. Lots of weapons and accessories to unlock (available in multiple languages).", "owner_name": "Dono", "downloads": 145306, "favourites": 65, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": true, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "Creative Commons BY-NC-ND 4.0", "guid": "com.dono.aes", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Traders", "category_id": 16, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T07:51:43.000000Z", "created_at": "2023-05-05T08:48:51.000000Z", "published_at": "2023-05-05T08:48:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0.2", "latest_version": "0.7.9", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/legalcode", "description_html": "\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">DESCRIPTION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Anastasia provides a wide range of weapon accessories!</p>\n<p>Some examples of what she offers :</p>\n<p><strong>Svetlana</strong>, a BEAR soldier, plays a crucial role as a go-between for newcomers and the missions given to recruits. She is known for providing reliable, high-quality weapons, as well as weapons customized to meet the specific needs of the soldiers. The best part is that the prices are 20% cheaper than any other trader, and she can provide unlimited quantities of weapons if the work is of high quality. All in all, Svetlana is an indispensable resource for the BEARs and their mission.</p>\n<p>Some examples of what she offers :</p>\n<p><strong>EVELYN,</strong> a seasoned USEC veteran and adept entrepreneur in Tarkov, leads the charge to reclaim Terragroup assets, rallying fellow operatives with a 15% exclusive discount. Her mission is to expose secrets and seek revenge for their abandoned main command after the contractors’ war.</p>\n<p>Here’s a little exemple of what she offers:</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">INSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>UNZIP all to the <strong>root folder</strong> of SPT-AKI where Aki.Launcher &amp; Aki.Server is located.</p>\n<p>YOU HAVE TO DOWNLOAD <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/885-virtual-s-custom-quest-loader/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Virtual’s Custom Quest Loader</a> MOD TO USE THOSE TRADERS CORRECTLY! ONLY FOR Pre SPT4</p>\n<p>YOU HAVE TO DOWNLOAD <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2310/wtt-commonlib\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT Common Lib</a> MOD TO USE THOSE TRADERS CORRECTLY! ONLY FOR SPT4</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">LANGUAGES</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>Here are the currently supported languages :</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Chinese</li>\n<li>Czech</li>\n<li>English</li>\n<li>ES-MX</li>\n<li>French</li>\n<li>German</li>\n<li>Italian</li>\n<li>Portuguese - SPT4 Version</li>\n<li>Japanese</li>\n<li>Russian</li>\n<li>Turkish</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">COMPATIBILITY</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1409-algorithmic-quest-randomizer/?highlight=Algorit#overview\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Algorithmic Quest Randomizer</a> ==&gt; Load it before Virtual’s Custom Quest Loader in the Mod Order</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/334-kiki-degradationremover/?highlight=kiki\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Kiki-DegradationRemover</a> ==&gt; Load it before A.E.S. in the Mod Order</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">DISCORD</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>To report any bugs or propose any suggestion about the mod (Quest, Items, etc.) here’s the Discord for that:</strong></p>\n<p><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.gg/Sd9NunUuxb\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://discord.gg/Sd9NunUuxb</a></strong></p>\n<p>Special Thanks :</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/26520-virtual/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Virtual</a> for his VIRTUAL’S CUSTOM QUEST LOADER MOD</li>\n</ul></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>Feel free to post a comment and/or a review of the mod and potential additions you would like to see. Have fun !</strong></p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "0.3.3", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.7.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1615, "published_at": "2023-10-26T16:08:06.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/874/aes/0.3.3", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "0.4.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.7.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1431, "published_at": "2023-11-12T20:44:52.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/874/aes/0.4.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "0.4.5", "spt_version_constraint": "3.9.4", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1925, "published_at": "2024-07-29T02:18:55.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/874/aes/0.4.5", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "0.4.7", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 16889, "published_at": "2024-08-09T20:07:58.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/874/aes/0.4.7", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_pat